  "_comment": "Curated regression dataset for QuestionDetector, evaluated by evaluate_detector.py. Each case replays `utterances` in order through one fresh QuestionDetector instance (so multi-turn context/correction/follow-up cases are real, not flattened). Expectations apply to the LAST utterance. `gap_ms` is the synthetic time since the previous utterance (or since t=0 for the first), fed to QuestionDetector.inspect(now=...) so window/stabilization logic is exercised deterministically, with no real sleeping.",
